POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "123",
  "itemId": "item-1",
  "quantity": 2
}

### List all orders

GET http://localhost:8080/orders

### Get a single order (status is filled in once inventory-service reports back)

GET http://localhost:8080/orders/123

### Watch an order's status live instead of polling the call above.
### Sends the current status right away, then every change, then closes
### as soon as the order reaches a terminal state.

GET http://localhost:8080/orders/123/status
Accept: text/event-stream

### Rejected by inventory-service: item-3 is seeded with only 5

POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "124",
  "itemId": "item-3",
  "quantity": 999
}

### Delete an order

DELETE http://localhost:8080/orders/123
